.trunk-cache/

# Go workspace
go.work
go.work.sum

# Dependency directories
vendor/
# ... except the SPA's vendored browser libraries, which are committed on
# purpose: `go build` is the whole build (no Node, no npm, no bundler), so
# preact/htm ship in the repo, pinned and go:embed-ed, and are never fetched
# by anything (docs/plans/2026-08-31-serve-spa-design.md §Settled decisions).
!internal/serve/vendor/

